- **Header tabs**: Clicking switches the main view (if user has permission); use React Router Routes. Tab visibility changes as per role.
- **Side Panel:**
  - Hamburger toggles open/closed state.
  - Expand/collapse document categories; clicking document selects/references it in chat.
  - “Active History” (Admin): click loads previous conversation.
  - Side panel animation duration: `transition-all duration-300`
- **Chat Workspace:**
  - **New Chat:** clears messages and conversation state, shows prompt tiles.
  - **Prompt Tile:** On select, tick checkbox, fill chat input, and send to AI.
  - **Message Sending:** Validate (not empty, not sending), clear after send.
  - **File Attachment:** Validate type (`.pdf`, `.docx`, `.txt`) and size (<10MB); error if invalid.
  - **Streaming Assistant:** Simulate loading/typing, show loading pulse.
- **Responsiveness:**
  - Full responsiveness mobile → desktop. Side panel collapses entirely to an icon bar on <md breakpoints.
